      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[BufferPad now keeps itself up to date.

- **Check for Updates…** in the BufferPad menu looks for a new version now.
- BufferPad also checks once a day and asks before installing. You can turn that off in Settings › General › App.
- If an agent is in the middle of a prompt, BufferPad waits for it to finish before restarting to update.]]></description>
